title: AWS v2 Glacier: Vault
agents: aws_v2
catalog: cloud/aws
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the archives of AWS/Glacier vaults and reports

 - the number of archives

 - size of the vault

 To make this check work you have to configure the related
 special agent {Amazon Web Services (AWS) v2}.

 There are no default levels set for the vault size.
 Upper levels are configurable.

item:
 Name of the vault.

discovery:
 Each vault is a piggyback host with the name {<vault name>_<region>}.
 One service is created on this host.
